{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>WISHLIST US</u> :O</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All assets, screenshots, and trailers are from an early development build and do not represent the final game. Expect major evolutions as we iterate!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All is well in the small mountain town of Metra, far away from the woes of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the shadow of war is crawling closer and darkness looms ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teneb and Aora, the only hope for humanity,\u00a0fight to free the world from its demons.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow their story in <strong>The Gold Maker : Rendez-vous with Death</strong>, a 3D fantasy RPG created by StudioTraexid featuring:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>rewarding loot</strong>, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- a fascinating quest, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- smooth dialogues, and</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- original turn-based combats against playful animals, terrible people and terrifying creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NO AI, 100% HUMAN </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3309850?t=1769782688","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3309850?t=1769782688","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309850/1f98fc66ebe2cbc3fb758ef19e35165e0be036b3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769782688","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309850/1f98fc66ebe2cbc3fb758ef19e35165e0be036b3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769782688","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed